#. i18n: file ui/skypeeditaccountbase.ui line 429
#: rc.cpp:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each application that wants to use skype must tell a name to it and user is "
"asked weather to allow such application to access it."
"<br>\n"
"By default, kopete provides kopete as its name, but if you suspect another "
"application that it access skype with this name, you can set another and "
"disallow applications that tries to log in as kopete."
msgstr ""
"Programmen, de Skype bruken wüllt, mööt en Naam angeven. De Bruker warrt denn "
"fraagt, wat dit Programm den Verlööf för't Togriepen kriegen schall."
"<br>\n"
"Standardwies gifft Kopete as Naam \"kopete\" an. Wenn Du dor bang vör büst, dat "
"en anner Programm över dissen Naam op Skype togriepen deit, kannst Du hier en "
"anner Naam angeven un Skype vertellen, dat \"kopete\" keen Verlööf kriegen "
"schall."

