#: rc.cpp:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What bus do you want to use to connect to Skype."
"<br>Session: Your own, other people can not get to that. (use "
"--use-session-dbus to start skype on that bus)."
"<br>System: This one is shared by all people on the same computer. Oddly, this "
"one is used by default by Skype.it."
"<br>You have to use the same as uses Skype"
msgstr ""
"De Bus, den Du bi't Tokoppeln na Skype bruken wullt."
"<br>Törn: Dien Egen, anner Lüüd köönt em nich faatkriegen (Skype mit "
"\"--use-session-dbus\" starten)"
"<br>Systeem: Warrt vun all Lüüd an den Reekner deelt. Skype bruukt standardwies "
"dissen Bus."
"<br>Du muttst den sülven Bus as Skype bruken."

